<item name='OriginalModTime'><datetime dst='true'>20090806T110447,83-04</datetime></item>
<item name='HFText'><text>Yes</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Checking Project Status</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Vérification du statut financier d'un projet</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>3</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>3</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>As a PI, you can check to see how much has been committed against one of your projects in four budgeting areas as well as the total committed.  These areas are:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Operating</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - day-to-day expenses for a project</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Travel</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - duty, conference, taxis, etc.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Contract</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - on-site contractors (e.g. CAC salary), off-site contractors (e.g. university colleagues)</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Capital</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - equipment purchases over $5,000</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To check the financial status of a project:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Enter the Admin area of the database by clicking on Admin on the Navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
