<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='0.9618in' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='4'>2.  Click on Projects on the Navigator after entering the Admin area.</par>
<par def='4'/>
<par def='4'>3.  Double click on the project of interest.</par>
<par def='4'/>
<par def='4'>4.  Scroll down the page to the Project Budget area of the project.  See the example below.</par>
<par def='4'/>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='1.6500in' firstlineleftmargin='1.5000in'/>
