<par def='4'/>
<par def='4'>5.  In the table you will see the current budget information for each area (operating, travel, contract, capital) and how much has been committed, or spent, against each of these areas.  Below the table is the total for the entire project, budget and funds committed.</par>
<par def='4'/>
<par def='4'>6.  To calculate the amount remaining, or free balance, simply subtract the amount committed from the amount budgeted.</par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='0.9618in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/>Free balance = Budget - Committed</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='7' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>En tant que CP, vous pouvez vérifier quel montant a été engagé pour l'un de vos projets, ainsi que le montant total, selon les quatre catégories financières suivantes :</run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='8' leftmargin='1.0625in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='8'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Opérations courantes</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/> - dépenses quotidiennes d'un projet</run></par>
<par def='8'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Déplacement</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/> - fonction, conférence, taxis, etc.</run></par>
<par def='8'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Contrat</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - sous-contractants internes (par ex., salaires CVC), sous-contractants externes (par ex., collègues d'universités)</run></par>
<par def='8'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Capital </run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>- achats d'équipements de plus de 5 000,00 $.</run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Afin de vérifier le statut financier d'un projet :</run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='9' leftmargin='1.0625in' rightmargin='93%' list='number'/>
<par def='9'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Cliquez sur la touche </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Admin</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> pour entrer dans la section administrative de la base de données.</run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='10' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='10'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run><picture
